        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/wet/scene_rat_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository b021c745-33ca-4e70-99fb-676f3ee211cd).Image",
        "Description": "They thought the Constant died on that train. They were all wrong.\rFour analysts ran the Project. The guard stood outside the chamber. But he saw your eyes open. Heard the first breath. Walked away.\rYou — are Edwards. You remember everything.\rThese five people know you&apos;re alive, that you exist. They don&apos;t deserve an explanation.\rSome secrets are worth killing for. This is one of them.\rMake it happen.\r\r(Use The Gauze Suit)",
